# Surge/Clash text ruleset fixture (rules owner)
# Comments and blank lines must be skipped.

DOMAIN,example.com,PROXY
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,example.org
IP-CIDR,1.2.3.0/24,no-resolve
IP-CIDR6,2001:db8::/32
DOMAIN-REGEX,^ads?[0-9]*\.example\.com$,PROXY
AND,((DOMAIN,a.com),(NETWORK,tcp)),PROXY
DOMAIN,source-target.example.com,LegacyPolicy
GEOIP,CN,DIRECT
FINAL,PROXY
